.TH batten-lint 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-lint \- Lint an artifact against a declared schema
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten lint\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Lint an artifact against a declared schema
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
batten\-lint\-brief(1)
Check a delegation brief against the handoff schema (any missing section is a violation)
.TP
batten\-lint\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
